{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_37386","headline":"九日游中溪 · 唐彦谦","name":"九日游中溪","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"悠悠循涧行，磊磊据石坐。\n林垂短长云，山缀丹碧颗。\n蓼花最无数，照水娇婀娜。\n何知是节序，风日自清妥。\n羣童竞时新，万果间蔬蓏。\n欣然爲之醉，乌帽危不堕。\n此日山中怀，孟公不如我。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"唐彦谦","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_37386.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_37386","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}